WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You are one of my oldest,
dearest friends.

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:06.573
And one of my heroes, both of
our heroes is Jerry Seinfeld.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.908
And you did "Comedians in Cars"
this year,

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:12.145
which I was so excited about.
How was that experience for you?

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:14.547 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It was great.

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:17.650 line:92%
Now, me and Jerry are friends,

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it's a new friendship.
-Yeah.

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:23.823 line:92%
-And he's 65 and a billionaire.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:26.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-So it's hard to navigate

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:29.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
where he's like, "Text me."
I'm like, "Okay."

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:32.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I'll text him,
and it's sort of --

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:34.434 line:92%
I'm cautious. Texted him.

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:37.237
I was coming in yesterday,
so I texted him on Monday.

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:40.440 size:84% position:42%
Said, "Hey, going to be
in the city tomorrow.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.108 line:92%
Me and our mutual friend John,

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:43.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
going to get some coffee
if you want join us."

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
He doesn't text me back
for, like, a day,

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:49.582 line:92%
which is terrifying and hurtful

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:53.586
because if a normal person
doesn't text you back, fine.

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:54.888 line:92%
Jerry not texting you back --

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:58.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
you can picture in your head
from the sitcom of him

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
looking at his phone
and going like,

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:02.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Neal Brennan, he's not
important to me."

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.164 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:08.735
So he eventually texted me back
last night,

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
said, "Sorry
I couldn't make it."

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:12.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then he sent me
a YouTube clip

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:15.508 line:92%
which was just clips of him.

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:17.811 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.811 --> 00:01:19.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which was him being like,
"I couldn't make it,

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:22.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
but this is the sort of things
I would have said...

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:23.983 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:26.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
...had I shown up."
[ Applause ]

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:30.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, good. All right, good.
Good.

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:31.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm going to start doing that
where I'm going to go,

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hey, I can't make it
to your wedding,

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:37.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
but here's a clip of me
on George Lopez's talk show

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:40.133 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
from 2012."

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.035 line:92%
-I thought it was very nice.

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:43.403 align:start size:94% position:6%
I enjoyed the episode
a great deal.

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:47.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have a dog, and he brought
dog treats for the dog?

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:47.907 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-He brought dog treats.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:50.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm sure he went to the store
and got them.

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:51.978 size:81% position:41% line:92%
He brought dog treats.

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:56.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
He bought Ben &amp; Jerry's
beef jerky, right?

00:01:56.316 --> 00:01:59.018 line:92%
Which you know dogs love.

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.420 line:92%
So he brings -- My dog --

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:03.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Dogs love brands.
-Yeah, they love branding.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:06.893 line:92%
Now, my dog loved the beef jerky

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:09.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Jerry gave him,
but it gave him

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:12.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
what is known in the business
as diarrhea.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:14.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:17.804 size:78% position:39%
-So I can't give him
those treats anymore.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:19.005 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I give him other treats.

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:20.673 line:92%
So now when I give him treats,

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
he looks at me the way
comedy audiences

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:24.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
have been looking at me
for a decade,

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:27.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is,
"You're no Jerry Seinfeld."

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:29.682 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:33.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which is painful. Yeah.
Yes! Yes!

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:35.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have enjoyed over
the years --

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.557 size:78% position:39%
I like talking to you
about your family.

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:38.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
You come from
a very large family.

00:02:38.591 --> 00:02:40.226 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How's your mother?
-How's my mother?

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
My mother is very good.
-Great.

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:43.062 line:92%
-Yeah, she was very happy.

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:45.231
I had to call her yesterday
with a question about --

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:47.300
my mother was a French teacher,
a middle school French teacher.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:48.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Of course.
-I had a French question.

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:51.437 size:84% position:42%
And she was thrilled.
-What was the question?

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:54.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We just wanted --
Amber Ruffin does that piece,

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:56.543
"Amber Says what?"
And we wanted the French "what."

00:02:56.543 --> 00:03:01.181
And we wanted to make sure it
was "quoi" and not "quelle."

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:03.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Great.
-Simple question.

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:04.384 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:07.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it makes your mom
feel useful.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:10.990 size:88% position:44%
-Oh, yeah, she'll wonder
why she didn't get paid.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:12.859 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:14.561 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-How old's your mom?

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:16.829 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-She was born in '48.

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:19.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
So uh, a hundred.
-70. Yeah.

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:23.002 size:88% position:44% line:92%
My mom's going to be 85.

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:26.272
I'm, like, the youngest of ten.
Long story.

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:30.276
So she's at the age now --
every time I talk to her,

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:33.379 align:start size:94% position:6%
she tells me --
it's always Irish women --

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:41.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
who died and who fell in town,
of her friends.

00:03:41.154 --> 00:03:46.626
-Those are the only two options?
-Mrs. McGwiggen died,

00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:48.928 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and Mrs. O'Reilly fell.

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:49.929 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:51.764 line:92%
That's generally how it goes,

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:56.936
and it is interesting to say,
"Oh, good, she didn't die."

00:03:56.936 --> 00:03:58.671 line:92%
Like, "Oh, she just fell?

00:03:58.671 --> 00:03:59.239 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.239 --> 00:04:01.174 line:92%
Oh, good. Oh, that's good.

00:04:01.174 --> 00:04:03.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's great.
I'm glad she fell."

00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:04.711 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:07.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, old people falling --
I never --

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:11.050
I don't see old people falling.
I always see the aftermath.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:12.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I don't think anyone

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:13.119 line:92%
ever sees old people fall.

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:15.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
You just see them
being tended to afterward.

00:04:15.855 --> 00:04:19.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it usually -- they
just look shocked like this.

00:04:19.092 --> 00:04:20.693 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Like [panting]

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:24.464 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:24.464 --> 00:04:27.433 line:92%
Like, just total bewilderment.

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:30.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
And like --
and you kind of get the look,

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:34.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, you get, they're like,
"Should I even get up?

00:04:34.207 --> 00:04:35.575 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:37.644 line:92%
Is it even worth it anymore?"

00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:40.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think you might not
see them fall

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:41.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I think they fall
so slowly.

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:46.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Maybe I'm passing
old people falling constantly.

00:04:46.152 --> 00:04:49.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I don't even --
I'm not even aware of it.

00:04:49.355 --> 00:04:52.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
Remotely.
-There's a photo.

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:55.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
A photo of us from
years ago at a party.

00:04:55.461 --> 00:05:00.433
-This is proof you're having --
you had your second kid.

00:05:00.433 --> 00:05:02.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I'm still single.

00:05:02.535 --> 00:05:04.070 line:92%
-Yeah. We are the same age.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:07.106 line:92%
-Yes. We have different --

00:05:07.106 --> 00:05:09.475 align:start size:94% position:6%
We've had different luck
in romance.

00:05:09.475 --> 00:05:10.209 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Uh-huh.

00:05:10.209 --> 00:05:12.845 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-It may be my fault.

00:05:12.845 --> 00:05:14.614 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.614 --> 00:05:16.716 line:92%
You present better than I do.

00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:17.817 line:92%
-I don't think that's true.

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:19.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're more charismatic
than me.

00:05:19.385 --> 00:05:21.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're very charismatic.
-Tell me about it.

00:05:21.788 --> 00:05:22.989 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But I'm saying...

00:05:22.989 --> 00:05:23.756 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:23.756 --> 00:05:27.160
I'm saying, you're a little
more charismatic than me.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:31.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this is a photo
from a nightclub in 2004.

00:05:31.264 --> 00:05:33.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Mm-hmm.
-This is why Seth

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
is happily married
with two children

00:05:35.668 --> 00:05:38.404 line:92%
and I am still on Instagram.

00:05:38.404 --> 00:05:39.972 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:41.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'll let the audience judge.
-Yes.

00:05:41.474 --> 00:05:44.510
-Who is -- because maybe it's
in the eye of the beholder.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:45.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe people look at this
and be like,

00:05:45.545 --> 00:05:47.480
"I think Neal is the charismatic
one in this photo."

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:51.017 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, here we go.
-Start close on Seth.

00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:56.189 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:57.990 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:02.962
-Let's get a little tighter.
Can we get a little tighter?

00:06:02.962 --> 00:06:07.433 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:12.939 --> 00:06:15.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah. That's a real, like --
me being, like,

00:06:15.775 --> 00:06:17.143
I'm talking to a girl and being,
like,

00:06:17.143 --> 00:06:19.512 size:84% position:42%
"Oh, does your friend
want to meet my friend?

00:06:19.512 --> 00:06:21.180 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He's...not here."

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:24.317 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:24.317 --> 00:06:27.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We were bad being single
because we would --

00:06:27.387 --> 00:06:29.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
The only thing -- we would
just go up to women

00:06:29.822 --> 00:06:33.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
and might as well go, like,
"Hey, you like skits?"

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.595 line:92%
Because you were like a low --

00:06:35.595 --> 00:06:37.697
You were just starting to get
good at "Saturday Night Live."

00:06:37.697 --> 00:06:38.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And I was starting to get --

00:06:38.965 --> 00:06:40.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So all we would do
is we would go to bars

00:06:40.633 --> 00:06:42.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
