also wanted to know.

00:06:46.005 --> 00:06:48.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're like, "What's that?
Act breaks?"

00:06:48.608 --> 00:06:49.142 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:49.142 --> 00:06:52.645
-"Were you gentlemen talking
about the rule of threes?"

00:06:52.645 --> 00:06:54.781 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah. Yeah.

